    fix(spec-alignment): treat an unreadable GitReins checkout as absent, not an error
    
    QA-AUGER-17: the cross-repo leg guarded the checkout with Path.is_file() — existence, not readability. A present-but-unreadable checkout (root-owned ~/gitreins on a bunker) passed the guard and then raised PermissionError at import, ERRORing three battery cells instead of skipping. Probe os.R_OK and skip with a reason that names the path and the failed condition; add arms proving unreadable-present skips and readable still runs.
